  "id": "USN-9198-1",
  "summary": "libhttp-tiny-perl vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that HTTP::Tiny incorrectly forwarded credential headers\nsupplied by the caller, such as Authorization, Cookie and\nProxy-Authorization, when following cross-origin redirects, including\nredirects from HTTPS to HTTP. An attacker could possibly use this issue to\nobtain sensitive information.",
